// fn_fixture (mid/names/limits/shape/cases/given/then/more/fixture/fn.id)
// registers "fx_target" straight into fnames/fnodes, the way a `calls`-clause
// check needs it, but does not add the hash-bucket entry fn_node_of actually
// looks through. fnreg_index adds just that entry, pointing at the row
// fn_fixture already pushed, so fn_node_of (and everything built on it) can
// find "fx_target" the way a real build's build_reg would have left it.
fn_idx_fixture() {
  init_idx();
  fn_fixture();
  fnreg_index();
} return void;
